{"id":"8773b1cdac488c9d","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-free-computable.md","title":"Free Variable Function Computable","display":"lem-free-computable — Free Variable Function Computable","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-free-computable","aliases":["92-lem-free-computable"],"display":"lem-free-computable — Free Variable Function Computable","depends_on":["[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-recursive-function]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]","[[92-df-pr-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-free-computable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-free-computable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-free-computable — Free Variable Function Computable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> (symbol code used by the Gödel numbering)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G\\)</span> (Gödel-code image constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqCode}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeqCode}\\)</span> (finite-sequence encoder, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FVCode}_G:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{FVCode}_G:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (total code-level free-variable function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> (recursive-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}free\\text{-}computable}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad \\mathrm{FVCode}_G(n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle c(x_1),\\ldots,c(x_r)\\rangle),\n&amp;n=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ \\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_r\\},\\ c(x_1)&lt;\\cdots&lt;c(x_r),\\\\\n0,&amp;n\\notin\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{FVCode}_G\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(\\mathrm{FVCode}_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}free\\text{-}computable}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad \\mathrm{FVCode}_G(n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle c(x_1),\\ldots,c(x_r)\\rangle),\n&amp;n=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ \\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_r\\},\\ c(x_1)&lt;\\cdots&lt;c(x_r),\\\\\n0,&amp;n\\notin\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{FVCode}_G\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(\\mathrm{FVCode}_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\)</span>本身取值于有限变量集，不能直接送入只接受数值函数的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span>或<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FVCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FVCode}_G\\)</span>把输出按变量码递增排序后编码为自然数，因此类型正确</li>\n<li>证明：对公式结构递归计算\n<ul>\n<li>原子公式：扫描项中的变量</li>\n<li>连接词：合并自由变量集</li>\n<li>量词：移除被绑定的变量</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>对合法公式码的有界解析、有限有序集合的合并与删除都是原始递归的；非法码统一映到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，故得到总 PR 函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-steps","status":"resolved","id":"573d6ccf155d773c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pr-function","status":"resolved","id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pr-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ (free-variable function, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ (Gödel numbering, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Code}_G$ (Gödel-code image constructor, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula set, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-steps","status":"resolved","id":"573d6ccf155d773c","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SeqCode}$ (finite-sequence encoder, see [[92-df-arithmetization-steps]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (recursive-function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pr-function","status":"resolved","id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-pr-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SeqCode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FVCode}_G:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}free\\text{-}computable}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad \\mathrm{FVCode}_G(n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle c(x_1),\\ldots,c(x_r)\\rangle),\n&n=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ \\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_r\\},\\ c(x_1)<\\cdots<c(x_r),\\\\\n0,&n\\notin\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{FVCode}_G\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(\\mathrm{FVCode}_G).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FVCode}_G","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":2153,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["b9e3d57e94ce36b7","d65795dc15ebce4b","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","573d6ccf155d773c","736154be0fae643a"]}